OL,3,GNEWSAFlag flown at half-mast after
OL,4,Adeath at council meeting
OL,5,
OL,6,FA town council's flag is being flown at
OL,7,Fhalf-mast following the death of a
OL,8,Fmember of the public at a meeting.
OL,10,FAttleborough Town Council said in a
OL,11,Fstatement the person suffered a
OL,12,F"serious medical emergency" during a
OL,13,Fcouncil meeting on Monday and
OL,14,F"subsequently passed away".
OL,16,FAn air ambulance was sent to help, but
OL,17,Fthe East of England Ambulance Service
OL,18,FTrust (EEAST) said despite all efforts,
OL,19,Fthe patient died at the scene.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,378,370,200,160,0,100
