OL,3,GNEWSAFlag flown at half-mast after
OL,4,Adeath at council meeting
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe council's deputy mayor, Daniel
OL,7,FPiddington, said he extended his
OL,8,F"heartfelt condolences to the
OL,9,Findividual's family and friends" on
OL,10,Fbehalf of the authority, which is
OL,11,Fflying its flag at half-mast as a "mark
OL,12,Fof respect".
